Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 21:54:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] mix.json: the ground sound thread's land block of 21:51Z
 (round eight's Good takes wired: woods crack, ricochet whines, steel hits,
 mortar landings, Panzer engine)

Brian stamped round eight at 21:41Z: Good for crack_woods, ricochet_whine,
steel_hit, mortar_impact and panzer_engine_loop; Cut for incoming_shell and
ricochet. land.cracks.single, land.groundStrikes.whines and
land.armourStrikes.smallArms take the Good ones; new rows land.landings and
land.engines. The WAVs and the code that reads the new rows are on the
ground sound thread's branch.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01L4rhz35oCkUv94Xb2EwCjp
